t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f1e3498 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f1e3498\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1302\" height=\"481\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Epithalon-10MG.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-55036\" alt=\"|\" srcset=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Epithalon-10MG.webp 1302w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Epithalon-10MG-300x111.webp 300w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Epithalon-10MG-1024x378.webp 1024w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Epithalon-10MG-768x284.webp 768w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Epithalon-10MG-600x222.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1302px) 100vw, 1302px\" title=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87a8ff3 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"87a8ff3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-92df433 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"92df433\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1336\" height=\"812\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/BLL-peptides-category-image.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-45048\" alt=\"BLL peptides category\" srcset=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/BLL-peptides-category-image.webp 1336w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/BLL-peptides-category-image-300x182.webp 300w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/BLL-peptides-category-image-1024x622.webp 1024w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/BLL-peptides-category-image-768x467.webp 768w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/BLL-peptides-category-image-600x365.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1336px) 100vw, 1336px\" title=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f82d4e8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f82d4e8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4feaae elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f4feaae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Do Peptide Vials Need to Be <span style=\"color: #018ACF\"> Vacuum Sealed?<\/span><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-69b2510 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"69b2510\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n \t<li><b>Vacuum sealing is NOT required<\/b> for peptides to be safe or effective. Most research-grade peptides are available in lyophilized (freeze-dried) powder form in a glass vial, sometimes accompanied by a slight \u201cpop\u201d when the needle is inserted, and sometimes not.<\/li><br>\n \t<li>The absence of a vacuum <b>does not mean the peptide is bad<\/b> or compromised.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-efcfafb e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"efcfafb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b81be8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3b81be8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-504b43b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"504b43b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Some Vials <span style=\"color: #018ACF\">Aren\u2019t Vacuum Sealed?<\/span><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d4a295 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9d4a295\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n \t<li>Vacuum sealing is <b>just one packaging method<\/b> and is more about sterility during manufacturing and shipping than about keeping the peptide \u201cactive.\u201d<\/li><br>\n \t<li>Most vials are <b>sealed with a rubber stopper<\/b> and an aluminum or plastic cap. The rubber creates a barrier to air and contaminants.<\/li><br>\n \t<li>Sometimes, a slight vacuum is created during lyophilization, but this is not required for long-term storage or efficacy.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44a389e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"44a389e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ebb3683 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ebb3683\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"698\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/labpratory-1.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-55130\" alt=\"|\" srcset=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/labpratory-1.webp 698w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/labpratory-1-262x300.webp 262w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/labpratory-1-600x688.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 698px) 100vw, 698px\" title=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7429839 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7429839\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47677e6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"47677e6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Is It Safe to Inject Bacteriostatic Water Into a <span style=\"color: #018ACF\">Non-Vacuum Sealed Vial?<\/span><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-687e8a8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"687e8a8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Yes, it&#8217;s standard practice<\/b> to inject bacteriostatic water into the peptide vial, regardless of whether it\u2019s vacuum-sealed.<\/p><p>The most important thing is <b>sterility<\/b>:<\/p><ul><li>Use a fresh, sterile needle\/syringe.<\/li><li>Swab the top of the vial with alcohol before inserting the needle.<\/li><li>Only use bacteriostatic water.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ebbdf8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1ebbdf8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4bb951 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a4bb951\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fabffef elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fabffef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What About Vials With <span style=\"color: #018ACF\">No \u201cPop\u201d or Suction?<\/span><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42c1896 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"42c1896\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n \t<li>Sometimes you\u2019ll feel a slight \u201cpop\u201d or suction when you pierce the rubber stopper\u2014this is normal, but the absence of it <b>does not mean the product is contaminated or fake.<\/b><\/li>\n<br>\n \t<li>If the powder looks as expected (usually white\/off-white, fluffy or cake-like), and the source is reputable, you\u2019re fine.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f6486d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6f6486d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d180ec3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d180ec3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"698\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/bacteriostatic-water.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-55065\" alt=\"|\" srcset=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/bacteriostatic-water.webp 698w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/bacteriostatic-water-262x300.webp 262w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/bacteriostatic-water-600x688.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 698px) 100vw, 698px\" title=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3199127 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3199127\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52b2b25 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"52b2b25\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">When Should You Be  <span style=\"color: #018ACF\">Concerned?<\/span><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f22fe5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4f22fe5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Do NOT use<\/b> the peptide if:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5de8e37 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"5de8e37\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-times-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm0 448c-110.5 0-200-89.5-200-200S145.5 56 256 56s200 89.5 200 200-89.5 200-200 200zm101.8-262.2L295.6 256l62.2 62.2c4.7 4.7 4.7 12.3 0 17l-22.6 22.6c-4.7 4.7-12.3 4.7-17 0L256 295.6l-62.2 62.2c-4.7 4.7-12.3 4.7-17 0l-22.6-22.6c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.3 0-17l62.2-62.2-62.2-62.2c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.3 0-17l22.6-22.6c4.7-4.7 12.3-4.7 17 0l62.2 62.2 62.2-62.2c4.7-4.7 12.3-4.7 17 0l22.6 22.6c4.7 4.7 4.7 12.3 0 17z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">The vial has obvious signs of contamination (liquid already in it, discoloration, mold, particles).<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-times-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm0 448c-110.5 0-200-89.5-200-200S145.5 56 256 56s200 89.5 200 200-89.5 200-200 200zm101.8-262.2L295.6 256l62.2 62.2c4.7 4.7 4.7 12.3 0 17l-22.6 22.6c-4.7 4.7-12.3 4.7-17 0L256 295.6l-62.2 62.2c-4.7 4.7-12.3 4.7-17 0l-22.6-22.6c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.3 0-17l62.2-62.2-62.2-62.2c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.3 0-17l22.6-22.6c4.7-4.7 12.3-4.7 17 0l62.2 62.2 62.2-62.2c4.7-4.7 12.3-4.7 17 0l22.6 22.6c4.7 4.7 4.7 12.3 0 17z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">The rubber stopper is broken or there\u2019s evidence it was tampered with.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-times-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm0 448c-110.5 0-200-89.5-200-200S145.5 56 256 56s200 89.5 200 200-89.5 200-200 200zm101.8-262.2L295.6 256l62.2 62.2c4.7 4.7 4.7 12.3 0 17l-22.6 22.6c-4.7 4.7-12.3 4.7-17 0L256 295.6l-62.2 62.2c-4.7 4.7-12.3 4.7-17 0l-22.6-22.6c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.3 0-17l62.2-62.2-62.2-62.2c-4.7-4.7-4.7-12.3 0-17l22.6-22.6c4.7-4.7 12.3-4.7 17 0l62.2 62.2 62.2-62.2c4.7-4.7 12.3-4.7 17 0l22.6 22.6c4.7 4.7 4.7 12.3 0 17z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">The peptide does not dissolve after adding bacteriostatic water (some clumping is normal at first, but it should dissolve with gentle swirling).<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bbd0fdf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bbd0fdf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f79119 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6f79119\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5077b8f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5077b8f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Summary<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-962df15 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"962df15\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n \t<li><b>Vacuum seal is not required.<\/b><b>\n<\/b><\/li><br>\n \t<li>It is <b>normal and safe to push bac water into a vial<\/b> that isn\u2019t vacuum sealed.<\/li><br>\n \t<li><b>Sterility and appearance<\/b> matter more than the presence of a vacuum.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0439320 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0439320\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc91e0d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"dc91e0d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"584\" src=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Vials-seals-banner-3.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-57335\" alt=\"|\" srcset=\"https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Vials-seals-banner-3.webp 800w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Vials-seals-banner-3-300x219.webp 300w, https:\/\/biolongevitylabs.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Vials-seals-banner-3-768x561.webp 768w, https